WEBVTT

00:02:57.590 --> 00:03:01.427
Jedino što je gledala na televiziji
bile su “Zvezdane staze”.

00:03:01.469 --> 00:03:02.720
(Aplauz)

00:03:02.762 --> 00:03:03.763
(Smeh)

00:03:03.804 --> 00:03:05.056
Živa istina.

00:03:05.097 --> 00:03:07.183
Nakon što su konačno udružili snage,

00:03:07.225 --> 00:03:11.187
nakon što ju je on zapravo
tri puta zaprosio

00:03:11.187 --> 00:03:12.480
i nakon što su dobili decu,

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:16.943
moja mama se pretvorila
u pravu ženu-ratnicu,

00:03:16.943 --> 00:03:18.361
spremnu za odbranu.

00:03:19.654 --> 00:03:22.073
Međutim, sve dok nisam

00:03:22.073 --> 00:03:27.203
u predškolskom dobila filmski scenario

00:03:27.245 --> 00:03:29.580
kako bih ga prosledila tati...

00:03:29.622 --> 00:03:30.998
(Smeh)